# AirWise Environment Configuration
# Optional: Google Gemini API Key for AI Copilot (gemini-3.8-flash)
# If omitted, the application operates seamlessly using calibrated deterministic domain logic.
# DO NOT commit real API keys to version control. Set this in your deployment platform dashboard (e.g., Vercel / Render).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional: Override default Gemini model (defaults to gemini-3.8-flash)
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
